{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three <strong>Galacard</strong> games in one package!\u00a0<i><strong>Galacard: Ackian Archives</strong>\u00a0</i>is a collection of modern ports of games from the Galacard series using the original graphics and enhanced music. The games included are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard</strong>\u00a0(2024) - The basic Galacard\u00a0experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Platinum</strong>\u00a0(2024) - Featuring an item shop and a new win system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Advance</strong> (2025) - Includes extra modes and different backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This series takes place in <strong>Planet Ack</strong>, which is inhabited by friendly people called <strong>Ackians</strong>. This small planet's favorite pastime is a traditional card game knows as Galacard, which they always like to teach to those who visit them.\u00a0 Yes, that includes YOU!.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three games were remade almost from scratch with modern systems in mind, while still retaining most elements from the original releases.\u00a0<strong>The general rules for Galacard are included in the menu.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Controls\u00a0 --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys - Move Cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter - Start/Choose Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space - Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Pause/Quit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alt+Enter - Change Display Mode (Window/Fullscreen)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D-Pad - Move Cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start - Start/Choose Game/Pause</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A (Bottom Button) - Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select/Back - Pause/Quit</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960510?t=1757638553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960510/9010df9bb23b154c130d90c76f6931bafc00201a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757638553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960510/8e64b4bac0bf9de1441f36c89ac2e4a1c64daadd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757638553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960510/8e64b4bac0bf9de1441f36c89ac2e4a1c64daadd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757638553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three <strong>Galacard</strong> games in one package!\u00a0<i><strong>Galacard: Ackian Archives</strong>\u00a0</i>is a collection of modern ports of games from the Galacard series using the original graphics and enhanced music. The games included are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard</strong>\u00a0(2024) - The basic Galacard\u00a0experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Platinum</strong>\u00a0(2024) - Featuring an item shop and a new win system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Advance</strong> (2025) - Includes extra modes and different backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This series takes place in <strong>Planet Ack</strong>, which is inhabited by friendly people called <strong>Ackians</strong>. This small planet's favorite pastime is a traditional card game knows as Galacard, which they always like to teach to those who visit them.\u00a0 Yes, that includes YOU!.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three games were remade almost from scratch with modern systems in mind, while still retaining most elements from the original releases.\u00a0<strong>The general rules for Galacard are included in the menu.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Controls\u00a0 --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys - Move Cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter - Start/Choose Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space - Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Pause/Quit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alt+Enter - Change Display Mode (Window/Fullscreen)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D-Pad - Move Cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start - Start/Choose Game/Pause</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A (Bottom Button) - Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select/Back - Pause/Quit</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bipedal Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960510/0031f9774501cb0a087d1ebb91f47d4775210ddd/header.jpg?t=1757638553","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 / SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl